                   debugging and is explicitly NOT intended for stable
                   testing. The only guarantee is that a specific perl
                   executable will produce the same results twice in a row,
                   there is no guarantee that the results will be the same
                   between perl releases or on different architectures.

                   Ignored if perl is run setuid or setgid.

